# Infoblox

> Infoblox is the global leader in DDI (DNS, DHCP, and IPAM) and DNS-based security solutions. Infoblox unites networking, security, and cloud to help enterprises simplify management, automate operations, and protect against cyber threats across hybrid, multi-cloud environments. Trusted by over 13,000 organizations worldwide, including 75% of Fortune 500 companies.

Infoblox provides protective DDI solutions that keep enterprises agile, secure, and prepared for modern network challenges. Key capabilities include real-time threat protection, network visibility, cloud automation, and preemptive DNS security.

